el":"Still Walking","channelTitle":"Still Walking","channelId":"UCD9clPtpOTsz7PPrm2JpafQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-03-22T09:34:54Z","viewCount":1246,"durationSeconds":3795,"admission":{"version":3,"status":"channel-candidate","source":"channel-archive","mode":"CITY"}}','1');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO videos (id,title,description,thumbnail,category,channel,channel_title,channel_id,badge,published_at,city,country,raw_json,active) VALUES ('UqzwixF4EMU','This Is What Izmir Güzelbahçe Feels Like at 4 PM | Turkey 4K Walk','This Is What Izmir Güzelbahçe Feels Like at 4 PM! ☀️🌊 Experience Izmir Güzelbahçe at this hour and discover the purest form of peace in this premium Turkey 4K walk. In this immersive 4K 60fps virtual walking tour, we step away from the hectic sunset rush to explore the most authentic, peaceful, and unfiltered side of Izmir''s beautiful seaside district during its quietest afternoon hours. Our journey begins at the very edge of the Güzelbahçe Fisherman''s Harbor, offering a stunning panoramic view of the town from the sea, backed by massive mountain ranges and charming 3-story houses. As we walk past traditional fishing boats and through the local fish market (Güzelbahçe Balıkçı Pazarı), you will experience the ultimate chill and relaxing vibe of the Aegean coast with full sea wave sounds. Explore the lively local seaside cafes, bars, and traditional Turkish restaurants (meyhane) where locals love to relax, contrasted by the unique character of forgotten, sea-weathered abandoned buildings. If you are looking for an Izmir travel guide, planning a trip to Turkey, or love slow travel and relaxing virtual tours, this Güzelbahçe beach walking tour is made for you. still walking 👣 📍 Walking Highlights & Timestamps: 00:00 - Cinematic Preview / Highlights of the Tour ✨ 00:49 - Fisherman''s Harbor & Panoramic Izmir Güzelbahçe View 09:24 - Fisherman''s Market (Turkey 4K Walk) 11:15 - Güzelbahçe Seaside, Relaxing Wave Sounds, Local Cafes, Restaurants & Abandoned Buildings Let me know in the comments: What does Izmir Güzelbahçe feel like to you at this hour? 👇 📍 Location: Güzelbahçe, İzmir, Turkey 📅 Date: May 31, 2026 (Sunday) 🕓 Time: 4:00 PM 🌡️ Temperature: 30°C continue walking here: 👉https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLe0tLqhfoJ0lD4A