me know in the comments: What does Izmir Güzelbahçe feel like to you at this hour? 👇 📍 Location: Güzelbahçe, İzmir, Turkey 📅 Date: May 31, 2026 (Sunday) 🕓 Time: 4:00 PM 🌡️ Temperature: 30°C continue walking here: 👉https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLe0tLqhfoJ0lD4ABpCnNmKAxMpHq607gz from an earlier time: 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLe0tLqhfoJ0kA5DZ-hMOT5mX-rHSVN8EK Contact: izmirexplorer@gmail.com #güzelbahçe #izmir #turkeytravel #4kwalk #walkingtour #travelturkey","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UqzwixF4EMU/maxresdefault.jpg","category":"Walking Tours","city":"Izmir","country":"Turkey","channel":"Still Walking","channelTitle":"Still Walking","channelId":"UCD9clPtpOTsz7PPrm2JpafQ","badge":"4K 60FPS","publishedAt":"2026-06-01T15:00:16Z","viewCount":1226,"durationSeconds":2130,"admission":{"version":3,"status":"channel-candidate","source":"channel-archive","mode":"CITY"}}','1');
INSERT OR IGNORE INTO videos (id,title,description,thumbnail,category,channel,channel_title,channel_id,badge,published_at,city,country,raw_json,active) VALUES ('N2-r4w60nYg','Esentepe, Izmir: An Era is Ending Here… A Neighborhood Saying Goodbye | Turkey 4K Walk 👣','Esentepe, Izmir: An Era is Ending Here… A Neighborhood Saying Goodbye | Turkey 4K Walk 👣 Down from Esentepe — where things quietly change, and memories wait for the dust to settle. This journey starts among the silent buildings of Esentepe, many of which are now empty and waiting for demolition. As we walk past these dozens of structures, we are not just witnessing a change in the skyline, but the fading of countless lives and old memories. For those who once lived here, these scenes are more than just a renovation; they are a final look at a past that is slowly disappearing. From the high, open hills of Esentepe, we descend toward the vibrant coast of Güzelyalı. This 4K walk captures the dramatic transition from the heavy, emotional stillness of the heights to the refreshing energy of the sea. Nothing planned, just following what appears—from the ghosts of old neighborhoods to the wide horizon of the city beyond. Atmosphere: Emotional silence, urban transformation, and expansive skyline views. Route: Esentepe Hillside (Demolition Areas), Steep Alleys, and the Güzelyalı Coastline. Experience: Real-time walking tour, natural city sounds, no commentary. still walking 👣 📍 Route: Esentepe → Güzelyalı, İzmir, Türkiye continue walking here: 👉https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLe0tLqhfoJ0lD4ABpCnNmKAxMpHq607gz from an earlier time: 👉 https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLe0tLqhfoJ0kA5DZ-hMOT5mX-rHSVN8EK Contact: izmirexplorer@gmail.com #i̇zmir #walkingtour #esentepe #citywalk #turkeytravel','https://i.ytimg.com/vi/N2-r4w60nYg/maxresdefault.jpg','Walking Tours','Still Walking','Still Walking','UCD9clPtpOTsz7PPrm2JpafQ','4K 60FPS','2026-04-09T14:30:16Z','Izmir','Turkey','{"id":"N2-r4w60nYg","title":"Esentepe